  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc3/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Review 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e: fixture with template twice, macro gen, iterator countTo, converter toInt (each calling helper) emits only main/helper/file symbols; calls from main go to nim:external:0-0:<name>:external_symbol and no helper edge comes from inside any of the four. nim.py dispatch (lines ~1238-1263) still covers proc/func/method/type/field/enum_field/variable only. MECHANISM: nim symbol extractor's declaration-kind dispatch omits iterator/template/macro/converter. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-tamib,WI-gudav."  # 0d12
